# Run artifacts, not checkers. The suites write debug dumps of rendered pages beside
# themselves; verify-postponed-branch drops an 82KB postponed-dump.json every run.
#
# They are ignored for two reasons, and the second is the one that matters: they dirty the
# worktree after every run, AND a dump is whatever the page happened to contain that day.
# Today that is public copy. Nothing guarantees the next one is, and this directory may be
# served. A checker is reviewed before it lands here; a dump never is.
*.json
*.png
*.jpg
